id=ecarx_e02_ihu717p_bt
name=IHU717P BLE/Classic Bluetooth support
version=2026.07.19
versionCode=20260719
author=Dmitry Nearlyny
description=Bluetooth support for ECARX E02 / IHU717P based Geely and Knewstar head units at the stock app path: A2DP Sink, HFP HF Client, PBAP Client, AVRCP Controller with working track metadata and physical media buttons (native libbluetooth.so AVRCP feature-negotiation fix), CarPlay/GOC watchdog. Force-connects A2DP Sink for phones that only offer Phone audio (e.g. Samsung Galaxy). NOTE: the stock NSMedia media app pauses Bluetooth unless the head-unit source is set to Bluetooth - select Bluetooth as the source (see README).
